<section><h2>Choose a learning path that fits</h2><p>TCM One programmes are delivered online, so learners can join from across Chhattisgarh without travelling to a TCM classroom. Review each course page for current fees, prerequisites, session timings and delivery details; programmes and schedules can change between cohorts.</p><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Web development &amp; Full Stack</h3><p>Explore frontend, backend and application-building courses with guided practical work.</p><a href="/courses/full-stack-web-development">View Full Stack course →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Data analytics</h3><p>Compare analytics training and tools covered in the current course outline.</p><a href="/courses/data-analytics-excel-sql-powerbi">View Data Analytics course →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>AI &amp; Machine Learning</h3><p>See the curriculum and prerequisites for introductory AI learning.</p><a href="/courses/ai-machine-learning-fundamentals">View AI course →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>DSA &amp; problem solving</h3><p>Review structured practice in data structures, algorithms and problem solving.</p><a href="/courses/dsa-problem-solving-java">View DSA course →</a></article></div></section>
<section><h2>Online technology learning across the state</h2><p>Whether you are studying in Raipur, Bilaspur, Durg, Bhilai or another part of Chhattisgarh, the online format makes TCM One’s scheduled cohorts accessible remotely. TCM One is based in Waraseoni, Madhya Pradesh; it does not currently claim a physical campus in Chhattisgarh. The Bilaspur campus is listed as upcoming.</p><div class="cities" aria-label="Chhattisgarh learning locations"><a href="/locations/bilaspur">Bilaspur</a><a href="/locations/raipur">Raipur</a><a href="/locations/durg">Durg &amp; Bhilai</a></div><p style="margin-top:16px">Read the local details for <a href="/locations/bilaspur">Bilaspur learners</a>, <a href="/locations/raipur">Raipur learners</a> and <a href="/locations/durg">Durg–Bhilai learners</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Looking for classroom computer courses in Bilaspur?</h2><div class="note"><p><strong>JMK Computer Education Centre</strong> is listed on TCM One as an institutional partner in Ashok Nagar, Sarkanda, Bilaspur. Its partner profile lists local classroom programmes including ADCA, PGDCA, Tally Advanced, programming, typing, computer operator exam preparation, and spoken and legal English.</p><p>JMK’s local courses are separate from TCM One’s online courses. Contact JMK directly through its profile to confirm current batches, eligibility, fees and in-person availability. TCM One does not certify or guarantee outcomes for partner courses.</p><a href="/partners/jmk-computer-education-center">See JMK’s Bilaspur partner profile, courses, map and contact details →</a></div></section>
<section><h2>Compare schedules and course details</h2><p>Before choosing a computer or coding course, check the published syllabus, level, live class schedule, total fee and any project or assessment requirements. Ask admissions if something is unclear. You can also browse the <a href="/locations">full list of TCM One online learning locations</a> or <a href="/contact">contact the team</a>.</p></section></main>
